WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Fractions on a number line

2
00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:09.767
Let us split the road from home to school into four equal parts. How far has Selam walked?

3
00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.400
We split the line from zero to one into four equal parts.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.600
Each jump is one quarter: one quarter, two quarters, three quarters, four quarters.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.233
Two quarters is at the same place as one half.

6
00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:25.167
So two quarters and one half are equal.
